As the player gains Burgle Points from successful burgle heists and defending their manor from other players, they will move to higher leagues. The game consists of a tutorial phase of 8 Leagues and the real game phase starts once they reach League 8, which is an endless game mode. The player will unlock new traps, accessories and outfits as they increase their leagues.

