==League 8+ [[File:Img leagbadge 09.png|30px]]==

'''Target Burgle Points''': 5,500, '''+50 for subsequences plus marks'''

When the player reaches the target Burgle Points, their league will be awarded with a +1 plus mark on their league icon, this value will increase by 1 every time they reach the target point again, which will raise by 50 points. They also gain around 70~80 exp on the Mythic Artifact accessories and Legend's Sack outfit, their Burgle Point will then be reset to 4,500.

